  <!--EN: This world needs to be repopulated and we will do our part\n\nInfo: As soon as they learn to walk, they can be sent out into the world, if they have a parent from another faction\n\nWarning: Duty means duty. You will need to gear your colony to support the playstyle-->
  <CB_Repopulationist.description>这个世界需要重新繁衍，我们将尽自己的一份力\n\n信息：一旦他们学会走路，如果他们有来自其他派系的父母，就可以被送往世界各处\n\n警告：责任就是责任。你需要调整你的殖民地以支持这种玩法</CB_Repopulationist.description>
